DISTRIBUTION SHAPE

Veritas depends on wyrd-evidence-core, a separate public package licensed
under Apache-2.0:

    https://github.com/Wyrd-Flux/wyrd-evidence-core

That dependency is installed normally by pip. Veritas copies none of it and
grants no rights in it; see its own LICENSE for the terms that apply to it.

Veritas ships no private corpus, no concept graph, and no internal source tree.
It is runnable by anyone with Python 3.11 and network access to GitHub.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

DERIVED WORK: PROVENANCE

Veritas' evidence primitives were extracted from internal source trees for the
public release. The extraction, the exact source paths and SHA-256 hashes, and
the operator attestation are recorded in docs/PROVENANCE.md.

One provenance fact is recorded rather than smoothed over: three of those
modules had NO VERSION CONTROL HISTORY AT SOURCE (NO_VCS_HISTORY_AT_SOURCE). No
commit history was fabricated for them, in either the extraction or this
repository.

The extracted public code carries its own Apache-2.0 license in
wyrd-evidence-core. No license file was added to, or modified in, any internal
source repository as part of that extraction or of this migration.

